Adaptation 07-opus-medium-effort

Added here, not in the fork. The owner's rule: a role that runs on Opus runs at medium reasoning.
An `opus` value without an `@` suffix runs at `medium` whenever it resolves to an Opus model,
whatever the sheet's `default effort` line says; an explicit `@<level>` suffix still wins, and an
`opus` value that a runtime maps to another vendor's model keeps the default effort.

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

